#: optimize_images_x/global_setup.py:54
msgid ""
"Optimize Images X was initially created by Victor Domingos and both inspired"
" and made possible by the work of many other developers, including the "
"makers of existing image processing utilities, Pillow, as well as the direct"
" contibutors to this project and to it's parent application, Optimize Images"
" (the CLI version)."
