#: optimize_images_x/gui/main_window.py:821
msgid ""
"The dropped images will be optimized in place, replacing the original files "
"(always work on copies). Dropped folders are scanned according to your "
"\"Recurse through subfolders\" setting.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to proceed?"
